s small moments outdoors, which he believes can make a big impact, especially when dealing with health challenges. Evan also considers hiking an awesome way to bond with nature and push oneself.\n\nSam shares similar sentiments, feeling that being in nature is tranquil and refreshing. Sam finds that connecting with nature helps them relax and rejuvenate, agreeing that being outdoors has a positive effect on their well-being. Both Evan and Sam recognize the calming and restorative qualities of nature, which they actively seek to incorporate into their lives for improved mental health.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Evan finds nature to be peaceful, calming, and fun. (event_time: 2023-08-27T10:18:00Z)\n  - Sam shares the sentiment with Evan that being in nature is calming. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Nature acts like a reset button for Evan's mind and body. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Evan encourages Sam to enjoy time in nature. (event_time: 2023-08-27T10:18:00Z)\n  - Evan asked Sam if being in the countryside helps Sam relax and get fresh air. (event_time: 2024-01-11T21:37:00Z)\n  - Nature brings peace to Evan. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Nature had a relaxing effect on Evan. (event_time: 2023-07-27T00:00:00Z)\n  - Evan feels captivated by the beauty of nature. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Evan considers nature a great experience. (event_time: 2023-12-31T11:00:00Z)\n  - Evan considers nature to be a great healer. (event_time: 2023-12-31T11:00:00Z)\n  