bers.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1415,"context_chars":5319,"retrieval_duration":0.5604557991027832,"response_duration":3.7619402408599854,"total_duration":4.3223960399627686,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer correctly identifies that three years passed between the adoption of Pixie and the other three dogs, which aligns with the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to determine the time difference between Audrey adopting Pixie and her other three dogs. It states that Audrey adopted Pixie on April 2, 2023, and that she has owned her other three dogs (Panda, Pepper, and Precious) for three years as of March 27, 2020. This means that the other three dogs were adopted around that time, which is three years before Pixie's adoption. Therefore, the context allows us to conclude that three years passed between the adoption of Pixie and the other three dogs.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Audrey adopted Pixie on April 2, 2023","Audrey has owned Panda, Pepper, and Precious for 3 years as of March 27, 2020"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_4","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_4_qa_91","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"When did John meet back up with his teammates after his trip in August 2023?","golden_answer":"Aug 15th","hypothesis":"John met back up with his teammates on August 15, 2023.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - John met back up with his team